 "description": "38 saal pehle Bharat mein 0 Grandmaster the, aaj 100! Ye kaise hua? Case study.\n\n- 1988: pehla GM; 2011 tak sirf 25\n- Academies, Tamil Nadu (~40 of 100), 2022 Chennai Olympiad, 2024 double Olympiad gold, online chess\n- 2022: 50 GM → Nov 2026: 100th GM Anuj Shrivatri (22, MP)\n- Aaj Bharat GM ginti mein duniya mein No. 4\n\nSources:\nhttps://www.nationalheraldindia.com/sports/how-did-india-achieve-100-chess-gms-since-vishy-anand-started-it-all\nhttps://en.chessbase.com/post/india-s-100th-grandmaster\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chess_in_India\n\nPhotos (Wikimedia Commons):\nFile:Chess game Staunton No. 6 perfil view 8.jpg | Wilfredor | CC0\nFile:Chessboard of Napoleon-IMG 0636.JPG | Rama | CC BY-SA 3.0 fr\nFile:Chessboard of Napoleon-IMG 0639.JPG | Rama | CC BY-SA 3.0 fr\nFile:Aerial SE Island Grounds Chennai Jul25 R16 07915.jpg | Timothy A. Gonsalves | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Chennai 9.jpg | Ganesh Mohan T | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Schachfiguren, König -- 2021 -- 9650 (bw).jpg | Dietmar Rabich | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Schachfiguren, König -- 2021 -- 9650.jpg | Dietmar Rabich | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Schachfiguren, König -- 2022 -- 0013.jpg | Dietmar Rabich | CC BY-SA 4.0\n\n#shorts #casestudy #chess #india #60seckhabar",
